OL,3,GNEWSAAgatha Christie letters reveal
OL,4,A'love-hate' of Poirot
OL,5,
OL,6,FLetters to be displayed in a new
OL,7,Fexhibition reveal crime writer Agatha
OL,8,FChristie's love-hate relationship with
OL,9,Fher Belgian detective Hercule Poirot.
OL,11,FThe letters, from a collection kept by
OL,12,FChristie's agent, are being loaned to
OL,13,Fthe British Library for the display to
OL,14,Fmark 50 years since the author's death.
OL,16,FThe exhibition which opens later this
OL,17,Fmonth explores how Christie's own life
OL,18,Finfluenced her characters and crime
OL,19,Fstories.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
